BEHAVIOR array-init

DESCRIPTION
  Initializes an int dynamic array in caller-owned memory (per spec 3.3 the
  caller owns the buffer, this callee initializes it). Layout: [len:8][cap:8]
  then cap 8-byte slots. Sets len=0 and records cap. The buffer must be at
  least array-buf-size(cap) bytes.

CONTRACT
  INPUT arr bytes 65536
  INPUT cap int 8

HASH 56eeb340

IMPLEMENTATION
  cv = LOAD cap 8
  STORE arr 0 8 0
  STORE arr cv 8 8
END
